GIMP Palette
#Palette Name: HarrisThoth - 12
#Description: Made for Lospec Discord September Study Palette Contest. The artist I studied was Frieda Harris, specifically the tarot she created in conbjuct with infamous Alisteir Crowley. I recently came into posession of the AGM URANIA copy of he deck which was made from the restored paintings she made. Even if this tarot was made by a jerk like Crowley, Harris art is worth it - it is enchanting, electric and overwhelming. I named my palette in her honour, as her name is often lost when discussing it even if she was the one who pushed Crowley to make it. Her paintings, more than his rants make this deck a piece of art for me. <br>
